(CLAUSE 1: RSO 15, Para 38\(ii\) \(Prohibition of Assignment inside FTL & Foreshore\)) Tj T*
(Lands classified as Eri Ulvoy \(tank bed\), Kalvai \(supply channel\), Odai \(stream\),) Tj T*
(or Kalingal \(surplus course\) are strictly prohibited from assignment or patta) Tj T*
(transfer. Even temporary cultivation \(B-Memo penalty\) inside the tank bed is) Tj T*
(barred, as ploughing loosens silt and accelerates tank shallowing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
